          "body": "The very trivial patch",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "created": "2008-08-13T14:00:20.916+0000",
          "updated": "2008-08-13T14:00:20.916+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12402306/comment/12622223",
          "id": "12622223",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "body": "Shai, Thanks for creating this issue and patch!\n\nI noticed you also modified the private reusableSD to be protected.\n\nThis field is just for avoiding creating a new object at each insert to the priority queue. \nNote that TopFieldDocCollector maintains its own reusable object for this matter, and it of a 'slightly' different type.\n\nI am wondering if the right thing to do is to (1) leave that field private, or (2) make it protected but then make TopFieldDocCollector  use it too.\nI'm inclined for option 1.\n\nWhat do you think? Others?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "created": "2008-08-13T14:33:06.414+0000",
          "updated": "2008-08-13T14:33:06.414+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12402306/comment/12622441",
          "id": "12622441",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "body": "IMO, TopFieldDocCollector should be changed to use reusableSD. FieldDoc extends ScoreDoc. That's the reason I modified it to protected - for extensions of TopDocCollector who maintain in PQ ScoreDoc types (either ScoreDoc or extensions).\nI don't see any advantage in marking it private, nor any disadvantage if any extension to TopDocCollector will maintain its own ScoreDoc instance.\nIt's just that we have TopDocCollector, TopFieldDocCollector and my extension to TDC which insert ScoreDoc instances into PQ, so it made sense to me to change it to protected.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "created": "2008-08-14T05:23:38.729+0000",
          "updated": "2008-08-14T05:23:38.729+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12402306/comment/12623267",
          "id": "12623267",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
